sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as External vLLM Server<br/>HTTP

    Note over S3, HF: Flow 2 - Model Loading (startup)
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        S3->>HF: KServe Storage Initializer<br/>downloads model weights<br/>AWS credentials
        Note over HF: Model loaded to /mnt/models<br/>AutoModel* initialized
    end

    Note over Client, BuiltIn: Flow 1 - Built-in Text Detection
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Client->>Orchestrator: Text generation request
        Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>8080/TCP
        Istio->>BuiltIn: mTLS + Platform Auth
        Note over BuiltIn: Run detector functions:<br/>regex PII, file-type,<br/>custom detectors
        BuiltIn-->>Istio: Detection results<br/>(detections array)
        Istio-->>Orchestrator: mTLS response
        Orchestrator-->>Client: Filtered response
    end

    Note over Client, HF: Flow 2 - HuggingFace Model Inference
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Client->>Orchestrator: Text generation request
        Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>8000/TCP
        Istio->>HF: mTLS + Platform Auth
        Note over HF: Tokenize input<br/>(max_length clamped)<br/>Run model inference<br/>(seq/token/causal)
        HF-->>Istio: Classification results<br/>(detections + scores)
        Istio-->>Orchestrator: mTLS response
        Orchestrator-->>Client: Filtered response
    end

    Note over Client, vLLM: Flow 3 - LLM Judge Evaluation
    rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
        Client->>Orchestrator: Text generation request
        Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>8000/TCP
        Istio->>Judge: mTLS + Platform Auth<br/>+ detector_id header
        Judge->>vLLM: Evaluation request<br/>OpenAI-compatible API<br/>(safety/toxicity/custom metric)
        vLLM-->>Judge: LLM judgment result
        Note over Judge: Map judgment to<br/>detection response
        Judge-->>Istio: Detection results
        Istio-->>Orchestrator: mTLS response
        Orchestrator-->>Client: Filtered response
    end
